{"text": "哈哈笑死我了，晚上吃啥", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "周末一起去玩呗，最近怎么样啊", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "今天上班好累啊，想躺平", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "这破天气热死了，空调续命", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "刚看完那部电影，真的绝了", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "我又胖了三斤，减肥失败", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "老板今天又画饼，笑死", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "困死了，昨晚追剧到两点", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "这奶茶也太好喝了吧，回购", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "又到周一了，好烦啊不想上班", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "晚上要不要一起打游戏", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "妈我今天晚点回家吃饭", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "这个梗我笑了一整天哈哈哈", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "最近手头有点紧，得省着点花", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "咱妈做的红烧肉我馋了", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "今天堵车堵到怀疑人生", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "我准备明年考个证提升一下", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "这游戏太肝了，肝到手软", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "周末回老家看看爸妈", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "上班摸鱼一时爽，一直摸鱼一直爽", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "这剧情也太狗血了吧我还是追", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "今天心情不太好，陪我聊会天", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "刚发工资，请你吃火锅", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "累成狗了，只想瘫在床上", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "这天气适合睡懒觉，不想动", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
